WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:05.980
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:12.400
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.540
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.580
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.250
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.020
I'm still sixteen, you know...

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.180
I don't want to get married to someone I don't even like...

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:14.210
I still have so many things I want to do!

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:15.970
Princess!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:21.870
The wedding with Lipa's prince, Peroguuli, is very important to us, the country of Marlo!

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:23.530
Princess!

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.860
They're so annoying...

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:29.610
In the first place, why does the princess's guard have to do this boring job?

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:35.800
This isn't something a legendary, ultimate, supreme, genius, beautiful girl who skipped grades and graduated from Harvard would do!

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:39.490
Isn't catching phantom thieves G4's job?!

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:39.770
Hey now, this job is also important.
Isn't catching phantom thieves G4's job?!

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:42.170
Hey now, this job is also important.

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:44.600
That's right, it's our job, Kokoro-san.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:49.390
If the princess breaks out, we'll have to do 10,000 squats. Don't lose focus.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:53.290
Isn't that what you guys are doing?! 10,000 squats for you!

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:54.300
We're not, really...

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.640
That's right, Kokoro-san.

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:56.980
Don't lose focus now.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:04.660
<i>I just want to be a normal girl!</i>

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:06.690
<i>Normal!</i>

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:15.250
Ahh, it's raining again today...

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.000
It's moldy!

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.560
The roof is leaking!

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.870
The humidity is at 100%!

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.050
It's the rainy season!

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:27.750
Hey Sher, get down from there and help out!

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.890
I can't get the mold off at all...

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.470
I want a dehumidifier!

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:34.020
Dehumidifier?

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.470
Dehumidifier!

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:40.120
Dehumidifier... it has a wonderful ring to it!

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.590
If only we had a dehumidifier...

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.280
That's right, a dehumidifier...

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.310
I want a dehumidifier!

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:49.460
A dehumidifier, huh...

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:54.370
Hey, since we're on vacation, let's go out on a gathering somewhere and not stay cooped up here!

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:55.710
Gathering!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.340
Agreed!

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.210
It's a gathering! It's a gathering!

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.510
Thank you!

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:12.570
Going out, are you? Such a carefree lot.

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:16.300
You do know that if you don't make a comeback with your Toys, you'll be expelled, right?

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:20.030
There isn't too much time left. Are you fine with that?

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.560
Yes we are, Henriette-san...

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.560
How can you be so sure?

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:25.330
That's...

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.180
That's what?

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:29.290
That's... well, you know, it's our...

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:32.470
It's our dream to become great detectives!

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:35.890
Our dream won't betray Milky Holmes!

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:38.540
I see. Dream, huh...

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:39.750
Yes!

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.970
I'm praying that your dream will turn into a reality.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.430
Thank you very much!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:52.390
The rain's stopped!

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.980
Now, let's make this day awesome!

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:56.770
Yay!

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.470
H-Hey! That! That! Look at that!

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:00.710
What? Who is it?

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:01.660
Huh?!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:02.960
Sher?

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:03.840
Sher?!

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.590
Sher's on TV?!

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:06.700
W-why am I―

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.490
Sher! What have you done?!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.650
Eh? Ah, what <i>have</i> I done?

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:12.230
What have you done?!

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:16.140
If you remember it, then a future of superb meals might be waiting for us!

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.210
Remember it, Sher!

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.380
Remember it, Sher!!

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:23.630
Yesterday, Princess Claris of Marlo arrived in Yokohama.

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:25.320
Marlo's...

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:26.110
Princess?

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:26.740
Which means...

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:26.760
A different person?
Which means...

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:27.860
A different person?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.680
Thank goodness, it was a different person!

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:31.680
I'm innocent!

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:35.780
So it was a misunderstanding. Take care of yourself from now on, Sher.

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:36.380
Okay!

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:36.890
Of what?

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:44.900
Tomorrow night, Princess Claris of Marlo shall tie the knot with Prince Peroguuli of Lipa at Yokohama Familia Church.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.570
Eh, so your doppelgänger is getting married...

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.120
She doesn't look too happy about it, though...

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:56.750
Huh? Sher's not here...

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.240
Where did she go?

00:05:58.240 --> 00:05:59.080
Sher!

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.180
Oh, so it's a mirror!

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:16.390
There, there! Hiyah!

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:21.310
Ah, you got it wrong! You're not a mirror!

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.860
Who? Who?? Who are you?!

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.230
Who?!

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:25.360
Who―

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.360
So you're Sherlock Shellingford, right?

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.180
Y-You really are a mirror?!

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.290
No I'm not!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:32.210
Ah, then maybe you're...!

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:33.160
Princess?

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.070
Princess??

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:35.370
Princess Claris?!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.790
Shh! I've come to meet you!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.560
The people of G4 were talking about you.

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:42.260
There's someone who looks just like me in this city, and she's a―

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:43.520
<i>Stupid detective!</i>

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:45.860
―a <i>great detective!</i>

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.590
Great detective?!

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:50.430
We really do look alike... with this...

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.130
Great detective Sherlock!

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:52.730
Yes!

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.380
Please, I beg you to be my―

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:55.970
Substitute!

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:57.270
If only for a day!

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:58.730
Leave it to me!

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:01.660
Ehh?! That's impossible!

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:03.190
Please!

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:07.350
If you don't become my substitute, I'm going to facewall myself here!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:08.620
W-Wait a moment!

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:10.370
So you're going to do it?!

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:11.310
No, um...

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:12.800
Believe in yourself, great detective!

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.270
Great detective?

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:18.890
Great detective Sherlock! No, great great great great great great great detective Sherlock!

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.780
Nothing is impossible for you!

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:22.000
Eh? Really?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.350
Of course, I'll show proper thanks, great detective. What would you like, great detective?

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:29.340
Um, well, ah, let's see... ooh, right, that!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:33.720
A year's supply's worth of fish paste! Or, um, Kama paste and Fish boko and... Ah!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.690
Dehumidifier!

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.390
Dehumidifier!!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:41.700
So we've come to an accord? I shall prepare a dehumidifier for you!

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.590
Thank you very much!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.620
Well then, let's switch clothes.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:46.650
Okay!

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:51.480
Sher!

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.150
Where'd you go?

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:52.740
Sher!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.410
With this, no one should be able to tell the difference.

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.590
You can count on me!

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:04.430
But why'd you want a substitute?

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:04.860
That's...

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:05.360
That's?

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:06.590
That's...

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.500
I have a dream to fulfill.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:11.130
Dream? A dream?!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:14.290
I see! Dreams are important, eh?

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.430
Princess Claris' dreams won't betray her!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.520
Great detective Sherlock shall properly carry out the role of a substitute!

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:26.270
<i>I'm counting on you. I'll be back before the wedding ceremony tomorrow night.</i>

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.560
Sher!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.280
Right, I'm Sherlock now.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.310
I'm sorry!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:35.800
I had to drop by somewhere really quick...

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:36.480
Sher...

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:38.400
Don't just wander off!

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.620
You're so helpless. Well, let's go.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.120
To the department cave!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.660
Department cave!

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:44.620
What's that?

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:48.110
A department store basement, duh!

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:49.510
Eh? Department store?

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:51.440
So you meant the department store!

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:54.470
Ah, it's been my dream to go there at least once!

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:58.680
I've finally arrived at Marlo Embassy!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.930
For the sake of Princess Claris's dream and that dehumidifier, I will...!

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:06.940
Everyone! The great detective Sherlock Shellingford is going to work hard as the substitute of the princess!

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:11.690
The princess has gone missing?! What in blazes have you done?!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.780
I was lazing around.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:13.950
I was having tea.

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:14.990
I was playing a game.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:15.980
I was lamenting.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.510
That stupid princess! The hell has she done?

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:22.050
<i>They're</i> the same, both inside and out!

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:24.080
Marple-sama! The princess has come back!

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.210
Princess Claris!

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.860
You should have more self-consciousness as the princess of Marlo!

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:32.920
The wedding ceremony is tomorrow, you know!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.090
<i>Alright! I'll do my best to be princess-like!</i>

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.540
Princess!

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:42.210
Do you understand what this means? The fate of Marlo rests on this wedding ceremony!

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:43.220
Fate, you say?

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.320
Marlo is a small and weak country.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:49.600
It cannot survive without Lipa's support!

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:53.300
If we do not hold this wedding ceremony, then they will stop their support!

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:55.030
We would soon go bankrupt!

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:57.860
Bankrupt?!

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:01.100
Prince Peroguuli has arrived!

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.580
He's here!

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:07.870
<i>It was love at first sight...</i>

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:08.540
<i>I...</i>

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:10.140
<i>I...!</i>

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:13.590
Excuse me.

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:17.550
<i>I wonder what kind of prince she's going to marry...</i>

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:23.140
<i>So macho!</i>

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:26.100
<i>But he's a gentleman!</i>

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.940
Now then, Princess Claris...

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:31.020
Please wear these.

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:32.910
Y-Yes?

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.690
Please make your sentences more cat-like.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:38.650
Meow?

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.270
Strawberryummy!

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:46.710
These chocolates are melting in my mouth!

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:49.620
Um... how much does it come to?

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:50.660
Here, a strawberry!

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:53.080
<i>Delicious...</i>

00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:59.200
What's wrong, Sher?

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:05.150
It's been a long-running dream of mine to eat sweets in a department store with my friends on my day off!

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:05.910
Sher...

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:12.110
That's rich!

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:13.860
Was it that delicious?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.240
Well then, we'll do a food sample gathering next!

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:16.860
Yeah!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.530
Y-Yeah!

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:22.170
Here you are.

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:27.830
Yes!

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:34.380
They're almost grilled!

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.930
This is so much fun!

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:45.510
It's been my dream to live a normal girl's life like this!

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.260
You're too much, Sher!

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:52.890
It's almost like you're not a normal girl anymore.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:57.220
Actually... Actually, I'm...

00:11:57.220 --> 00:12:02.530
...not Sherlock-san, but... the princess of Marlo, Claris...

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.740
Yeah, yeah!

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:14.100
I wonder how Sherlock-san is holding out?

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:17.960
Is this fine, Purrince Pero?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:19.880
Prince?

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:23.260
Please address me as your master.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.090
Meow?

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:49.780
Master!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.110
Master, welcome ho-meow!

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:54.830
More, more, more!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.500
Time for a purrize!

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:58.790
Wonderful!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.130
Now use these.

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:01.050
Meow?

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.010
Princess...

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.300
Take that! And that! And some more! Meow!

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:08.610
Damn piggy hunk of a meowster! Eat this!

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.010
PERFECT!

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:15.970
Aren't you disliking the fact that you're getting married to a pervert like me?

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:17.150
Not at all, meow!

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:20.230
Well then, I'll see you at the wedding ceremony.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:22.780
What was his purrpose in coming?

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.530
That was fabulous, princess.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:33.450
It's already night... I have to get married to that <i>dreadful</i> man, huh...

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:35.430
Here, your dinner.

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:37.080
One potato...

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:39.040
What? You got something to say?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.000
Yeah! Give us something better!

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.370
Yeah! At least some soy sauce!

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:43.170
And butter...

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:45.800
Greed is a deadly sin. Fight against it till you desire no more!

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:46.880
What's that?

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.230
Ishinagare-san, isn't that old?

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:49.180
Ishinagare-san, how old are you?

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.580
About 35?

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:51.150
Bastards!

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:57.600
It's been a dream of mine to have so much fun eating with everyone!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.610
Are you still playing princess?

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.070
What? What?!

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:09.480
Mm, what a feast! I bet there's about a hundred million calories in this!

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.100
Itadakimasu!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.990
Yummy!

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:20.740
It's yummy, but... I'm not too happy about it...

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.650
I'm in a cramped room that's humid and full of mold...

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:27.840
I'm sleeping together with the other girls on one bed...

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.800
I've always dreamed of living normally like this!

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.290
What's wrong, Kamaboko?

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:37.800
Aren't you coming here?

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:39.620
That's unusual...

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:41.060
Weird Kamaboko.

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:44.980
It's so big that I can't relax...

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:50.530
Cordelia-san, Herc-san, Nero...

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:55.740
No! I've gotta keep at it until Princess Claris comes back!

00:14:56.210 --> 00:15:01.460
For Marlo's peace... for Princess Claris's dream... for that dehumidifier!

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:05.790
<i>Tomorrow's the wedding ceremony... If I don't return by then...</i>

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:08.170
<i>But I'm...</i>

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:11.180
Itadakimasu!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:13.680
Hey! You can't take it all for yourself!

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:16.100
Hey!

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:19.180
A wonderfully normal life!

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:22.230
Normal life!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.980
Normal...life!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:30.240
<i>Princess Claris hasn't come back yet...</i>

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:35.240
Ahh, being able to live normally like this is so much fun!

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.530
It's been my dream!

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:40.250
Nonetheless, I have to go back, huh...

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.510
I have to...

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.410
Maybe it's fine if I don't go back?

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:49.290
I don't want to get married to that <i>dreadful</i> guy, anyways...

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:53.240
I feel bad for Sherlock-san, but I just want to keep living like this...

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:55.840
And you think it'll be fine like that, Princess Claris?

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:58.260
You're...

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.730
Just a student council president happening to pass by.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:04.810
<i>I'm sure... that the princess will come back!</i>

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.570
<i>Until then, I have to do my very best!</i>

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:13.320
I didn't want to be born a princess, but rather, someone more normal...

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:18.460
Friends to laugh with, play with, study with, and even occasionally fight with...

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.080
And to fall in love, too...

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:24.720
But now I have to get married to a guy I don't even like...

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:25.790
In other words, you're running away, right?

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:32.050
No! This is the life that I'd always dreamed about! And now I've gotten my hands on this dream!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:36.060
Dream? That's not something you can obtain by just running away.

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:38.300
It's something you fight for.

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:39.530
But...

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:44.190
Sherlock is continuing to fight for her dream of becoming a great detective.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:49.230
She's doing it without ever running away. Even now, too...

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:54.200
There's no way you can keep running away your whole life.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:17:00.220
My dream... The me that I've been aiming for...

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:02.040
The me that I've wanted to become...

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:05.000
To be... like that...

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:08.890
My...

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:10.170
My dream...

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:14.300
I will fight and seize it with my bare hands!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:17.470
I have an important announcement to make!

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:19.600
I am Marlo's princess...

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:21.060
Claris!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.080
She's really taken a liking to that joke!

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:28.070
Just because she got it several times!

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:30.980
The value of pi isn't 3! It's 3.14!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:31.930
Who are you?!

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:32.800
You're not Sher!

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.490
Could you really be?!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.490
Princess Claris?!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:36.990
Please...

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:39.240
Lend me your power!

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:43.590
So, we're to do whatever works to protect the stupid princess.

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:44.200
'Kay.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:00.850
Look! It's Yokohama Familia Church!

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:01.890
Everyone!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.150
Yeah!

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:09.480
Milky Holmes minus Sherlock plus Princess Claris!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.190
We're coming, Sherlock-san!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.300
Ruffians!

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:18.380
Milky Holmes?

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:20.180
Why are you here?

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:21.720
We'll stop G4 for you!

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.120
Look for an opening and head in, princess!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.350
Make way!

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.040
What?!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:27.540
Ow...

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:28.710
What's with these guys?

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:31.810
Please make way!

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:34.670
Huh? What're you saying, stupid Sherlock?

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:36.660
And what's with that getup?

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:38.550
I am not Sherlock-san!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.260
I am the princess of Marlo, Claris!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:43.920
Yes, yes. Be a good girl and go home.

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:46.940
The value of pi isn't 3. It's 3.14!

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:55.970
<i>The ceremony is about to end... and Princess Claris still isn't back!</i>

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:58.410
And lastly, the kiss of oath.

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:00.320
Eh? K-K-Kiss?!

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:02.620
Meow! Don't!

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:05.990
Not the kiss! A kiss means a <i>kiss</i>, you know! A kiss!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.910
Don't! Don't! Don't! Don't! Don't! Don't! Don't! Don't!

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.420
Grandpa!!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.360
Sher! Sher!!

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:18.680
Idiot! Idiot!!

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:20.130
You really had us fooled!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.190
Give it up, pretty boy!

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:22.840
Well, I think we've made it in time...

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.140
Everyone!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:30.530
Sherlock!!

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:34.490
That was scary!

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:35.770
There, there!

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:37.320
Different person?

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:40.170
I'm sorry I deceived you.

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:44.090
Princess Claris... what on earth is the meaning of this?

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:44.740
Prince Pero...

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:47.950
I have something I must say to you.

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:50.790
I cannot...

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:53.500
I cannot be betrothed to you!

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:56.390
Princess, Marlo will...!

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:59.760
Silence, Marple. I shall do something about my country.

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:03.590
I will not run away again. My country's peace, and my own dream...

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:06.450
I shall achieve them both with my own hands!

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.180
Yeah!

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.470
Princess...

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:11.970
Princess Claris...

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:14.960
I've been waiting for that.

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:19.940
My parents arranged this wedding without my consent.

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:24.450
I took off my clothes and acted like a pervert in order to get you to hate me.

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.780
It didn't work, though...

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.160
W-What do you mean?

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:31.540
To tell you the truth, I have someone that I like.

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:35.230
It was love at first sight...

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:37.040
From the first time I met her, I've...

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:44.490
Marple-san, will you marry me?

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.190
Yes.

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:06.810
Thank you, Sherlock. I was able to live such a dreamy life thanks to you.

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:08.390
Princess Claris...

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:11.980
I shall work hard in order to make that dream a reality!

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:13.080
I won't run away anymore!

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:15.450
Yes!

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:18.540
And so, Princess Claris's grandmother,

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:22.140
Marple-san, and Prince Pero were married.

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.590
It seems that the countries of Marlo and Lipa now get along super well together!

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:32.350
Also, the dehumidifier that Princess Claris gave us has become our treasure.

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:36.110
Don't hold that uncomfortable position!

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:37.360
What are you doing?

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:38.740
A whip and a candle?

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:41.890
Prince Pero taught me how to play a princess!

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:43.240
Everyone, you try it too!

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:47.420
Th-That's... not good!

00:23:18.430 --> 00:23:21.670
It surprised me when the Prince and that granny got so close together!

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:23.500
There's one more thing that'll surprise you.

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:24.370
Eh, what is it?

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:25.880
Everyone in swimsuits!

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:29.380
Oh man, you didn't have to yell it in my ear! Surprising enough as it is...

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:33.850
Those that want to stay back can stay back! And those that want to fight can fight!

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:37.480
If you strip away, heaven will bless everyone!

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:40.530
We'll ride the waves and get all wet!

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:42.750
Next time: The Sun's Playful Plays!

00:23:42.750 --> 00:23:47.280
The culprit is I~!
